# Cursor / any AI — WWG is mandatory

This project uses @homedesk/wwg. **You are not exempt** if you are Cursor, Claude, Codex, Copilot, or any other tool.

## Session start

```bash
npm run wwg:status
npm run wwg:brief -- cursor
```

Read `AGENTS.md`, `.wwg/reports/wwg-agent-handoff.md`, Project Truth, and Current Task before coding.

## New features

When the user asks to add/build/implement a feature, run **before** large implementation:

```bash
npm run feature:new -- <slug> title:FeatureName owner:cursor e2e page
```

Then fill `.wwg/workspace/features/<slug>.md` while building.

## Close-out

```bash
npm run test
npm run test:e2e
npm run wwg:validate
npm run wwg:brief -- cursor
```

Full rules: `AGENTS.md`, `docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`.
